# Exchange-certificate data: `E7` seeds

The seeds of the `E7` exchange-certificate data; its variables, exchange relations, cover
tree and raw certificate are in `CertificateData.E7`. Each seed is one natural number whose
bit fields hold its cluster, its matrix digits, its transitions, their relabellings and
relations, and its position in a breadth-first spanning tree. The definition is
`noncomputable`: only the kernel evaluates it.
